# Splitsies Privacy Policy

Last updated: July 2026

## Information We Collect

Splitsies collects the following information when you create an account:
- Email address
- Username
- Profile picture (optional)
- Phone number (optional)

## How We Use Your Information

Your information is used solely to provide the Splitsies service:
- To identify your account
- To allow friends to find you by username
- To display your profile to friends within the app

## Data Storage

Your data is stored securely using Google Firebase. We do not sell your data to third parties.

